12. **Bot AI/creator**: In `Bot.update`, `crouching: this.state === 'engage' && health low && Math.random()<0.01` random each frame means crouch flickers (crouchFactor damps). This is a visual thing. Better decide crouch state persistently. Could set a `combatCrouch` flag. Minor visual. But bots "crouch" randomly each frame; with 1% chance per frame at 60fps → crouches ~0.6s after being low, then stays because crouchFactor... Actually opts.crouching becomes true intermittently one frame at a time (1% per frame), so barely noticeable. Could improve with a stateful flag: `if low health && !this.crouchDecisionMade ...`. Not necessary.

